  "Design rule: no CP stealing"
 ],
 "risk_profile": "Medium. Gamble = durability: ram the skiff into the enemy to board this activation.",
 "core_rule": {
  "name": "Plunder & Cannonades",
  "text": "Plunder: once per round, when you destroy an enemy unit that was within 3″ of an objective, or an enemy Leader, gain 1 CP (your own pool cap still applies). Cannonades: [FLY] or [TRANSPORT] units may make a free 3″ move after they Shoot (not into engagement)."
 },
